  "summary": "Two functioning online grocery retailers yielded verifiable prices: Kathmandu Organics (organic-tier, Wix-based site with server-rendered product pages) and Online Tarkari Pasal (standard-tier, WooCommerce site with clean per-product pages and Nepali/English bilingual naming). Daraz Nepal, Thulo.com, KhetiFood, Bhat-Bhateni, and Sastodeal were all unusable (JS shells, 403 blocks, expired SSL, or connection errors), and this session's web search quota was exhausted partway through research, limiting further retailer discovery. Microgreens (beyond one mixed-mix SKU), cherry tomatoes, arugula, and edible flowers could not be found at any reachable Nepal retailer and are listed in notFound."
